 drop mines & telekinesis to kick some tanks in a crazy tank multiplayer.\nWelcome Commander!\nJump into the battlefield and fight your way through this crazy real-time tanks shooter multiplayer!\n\n+ Crazy High Speed Multiplayer +\nUse your tank's crazybilities to kick your enemies - jump behind them, apply your telekinesis force to throw them off the cliff & drop your mines from above.\n\n+ Fight Your Way To Victory +\nGlory, Honor, Eternal Fame - and a lot of other words we've found on the dictionary - you can find them all when you'll become a CrazyTank commander!\n\n+ Features +\n* Jumping tank with telekinesis force\n* Upgrades\n* Cinematics\n* Chat\n\n+ Cross Platform - Play Everywhere +\n* Android\n* Virtual Reality\n* PC\n\nWebsite:\nhttp://www.CrazyTanks.com\nPrivacy Policy:\nhttp://www.CrazyTanks.com/privacy_policy.html", "short_description": "Welcome to Crazy Tanks!\nJump into the battlefield and fight your way through this crazy real-time tanks shooter multiplayer!\n\n+ Crazy High Speed Multiplayer +\nUse your tank's crazybilities to kick your enemies - jump behind them, apply your telekinesis force to throw them off the cliff & drop your mines from above.\n\n+ Fight Your Way To Victory +\nGlory, Honor, Eternal Fame - and a lot of other words we've found on the dictionary - you can find them all when you'll become a CrazyTank commander!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "714434859598386", "locale": "pt_BR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "CrazyTanks", "keywords": [], "long_description": "CrazyTanks Multiplayer: The Army of Shadows\nSalte, solte minas e telecinesia para chutar alguns tanques em um multiplayer de tanques louco.\nBem-vindo comandante!\nSalte para o campo de batalha e lute no seu caminho atrav\u00e9s deste louco multijogador de atirador de tanques em tempo real!\n\n+ Multijogador de alta velocidade louco +\nUse as habilidades loucas do seu tanque para chutar seus inimigos - pule atr\u00e1s deles, aplique sua for\u00e7a de telecinese para jog\u00e1-los do penhasco e soltar suas minas de cima.\n\n+ Lute at\u00e9 a vit\u00f3ria +\nGl\u00f3ria, Honra, Fama Eterna - e muitas outras palavras que encontramos no dicion\u00e1rio - voc\u00ea pode encontrar todas quando se tornar um comandante CrazyTank!\n\n+ Recursos +\n* Salto de tanque com for\u00e7a telecinesia\n* Atualiza\u00e7\u00f5es\n* Cinem\u00e1tica\n* Bate-papo\n\n+ Plataforma cruzada - Jogue em qualquer lugar +\n* Android\n* Realidade virtual\n* PC\n\nLocal na rede Internet:\nhttp://www.CrazyTanks.com\nPol\u00edtica de Privacidade:\nhttp://www.CrazyTanks.com/privacy_policy.html", "short_description": "Bem-vindo ao Crazy Tanks!\nSalte para o campo de batalha e lute no seu caminho atrav\u00e9s deste louco multijogador de atirador de tanques em tempo real!\n\n+ Multijogador de alta velocidade louco +\nUse as habilidades loucas do seu tanque para chutar seus inimigos - pule atr\u00e1s deles, aplique sua for\u00e7a de telecinese para jog\u00e1-los do penhasco e soltar suas minas de cima.\n\n+ Lute at\u00e9 a vit\u00f3ria +\nGl\u00f3ria, Honra, Fama Eterna - e muitas outras palavras que encontramos no dicion\u00e1rio - voc\u00ea pode encontrar todas"}]}, "developer_name": "CrazyTanks", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.crazytanks.com/privacy_policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CrazyTanks", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.crazytanks.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": ["ACTION", "ARCADE", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor